  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cantonal Road Network II Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Red Vial Cantonal II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s general objective is to contribute to productivity growth and poverty reduction in Costa Rica by facilitatingcloser integration between production and consumption areas and improving the population&apos;s access to public and social services. Its specific objective isto improve the quality of the Cantonal Road Network through: (i) road rehabilitation and maintenance works that include a climate change adaptationcomponent, which will result in shorter travel times and lower operating costs; and (ii) strengthening of the institutions responsible for road networkmanagement.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">el objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la mejora de la productividad y la reduccinde la pobreza en Costa Rica (CR), facilitando la integracin de zonas productivas a reas de consumo y la conexin de lapoblacin a servicios pblicos y sociales. El objetivo especfico es la mejora de la calidad de la red de carreteras cantonales,mediante: (i) intervenciones de rehabilitacin y mantenimiento incorporando adaptaciones al Cambio Climtico (CC), queresultarn en reduccin de tiempo de viaje y costos de operacin; y (ii) el fortalecimiento de las instituciones responsables de lagestin de la red vial.</narrative>
  </description>
